why Every Horde quest of the Ruins of Lordaeron in one run, lead-ins included.

# The Ruins of Lordaeron's Horde quests in one guide: the lead-ins in
# Tirisfal and Silverpine, the pick-ups in the Undercity, one run through the
# dungeon, then the hand-ins and the Unending Torment chain the run opens.
# Steps already done are passed over, so the guide picks up wherever the chain
# stands.
#
# The chains:
# - Deathguard Linnea in Brill: 356 Rear Guard Patrol -> 99156 Rear Guard
#   Patrol (Riptear's Heart) -> Deathguard Kristof's 92422 The Wrath of
#   Rath'mael.
# - 447, 450, 451 A Recipe For Death, between Apothecary Renferrel at the
#   Sepulcher and Master Apothecary Faranell -> Theodore Griffs' 95216 The New
#   Plague (Witherfang's Highly Toxic Strain).
# - Morbin Lightbane's 92421 Light's Justice (25 Intact Limbs) and Tabitha
#   Heartweaver's 92401 A Frightened Request (Edward Heartweaver).
# - Inside: the Abominable Head (item 280438) from The Baron starts 97288
#   Unending Torment, for Faranell, and on through 97289, 97290, 97291 (a Toxic
#   Skullcap from Tawny Grisette, Blisterweed, Essence of Agony) to 97292 (the
#   Hissing Serum, by Othmar's body). The Crest of Lordaeron (object 614679)
#   starts 95204 Crest of Lordaeron, for Oran Snakewrithe.
#
# Left out: the Ruins of Lordaeron is a city dungeon of the Horde (its door is
# by the Undercity), so the pack has no Alliance guide for it; its five
# Alliance quests (95250, 92415, 95161, 95189, 95195) are not in this pack.
#
# Inside: nothing in the data places the bosses, The Baron, the crest or
# Edward Heartweaver's trail inside, so their goals stand at the door
# (@72.7,11.5, the Undercity's map) with `group 5`. The bosses come in the
# order of the client's dungeon journal (Witherfang, The Abandoned, The
# Butcher, the Lordaeron Captain, Viktor the Vile, Bjork, Rath'mael), not of a
# recorded run. Every quest goal is counted by the quest log, so a group that
# takes them in another order still gets each step ticked.
#
# Sources (facts only):
# - Quests, NPCs, items, objects, vendors and rewards: Polestar's reference
#   data (data/forever, built from QuestieDB Forever 1.1.4) and Polestar
#   0.4.1.1's Codex page for the dungeon. The serum's spot is the data's for
#   97292's objective.
# - The door: players' recordings, as Polestar's Codex holds them
#   (data/codex/entrances.json).
# - What drops where: players' recordings (data/codex/recorded.json): the
#   Abominable Head from The Baron (npc 250660, an elite inside), the crest
#   from object 614679, Essence of Agony on sale with Ezekiel Graves.
# - The dungeon's size, levels and bosses: the client's group finder and
#   dungeon journal, as Polestar's Codex page holds them (five players, levels
#   15 to 22).
# INGAME: where inside do The Baron, the crest and Edward Heartweaver's trail
#   stand, and what completes A Frightened Request?

