step The Baron
  tip An elite inside, not one of the journal's bosses. He drops the Abominable Head, which starts a quest for Master Apothecary Faranell.
  collect 280438 @72.7,11.5 group 5
  accept 97288 @72.7,11.5

step The Crest of Lordaeron
  tip A crest lies in the ruins. It starts a quest for Oran Snakewrithe in the Undercity.
  collect 275521 @72.7,11.5 group 5
  accept 95204 @72.7,11.5

step Rath'mael
  tip The last boss in the client's journal, for Deathguard Kristof. The Abandoned, The Butcher, the Lordaeron Captain, Viktor the Vile and Bjork come between Witherfang and him; no quest needs them.
  kill 250657 quest 92422.1 @72.7,11.5 group 5

